Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests::
    .string "Many POKéMON live only in forests \n"
    .string "and caves.\p"
    .string "You need to be persistent and look\n"
    .string "everywhere to get different kinds.$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_WaterGunOffer::
    .string "Heading to PEWTER CITY?\\p"
    .string "I can teach WATER GUN to a\\n"
    .string "POKéMON suited to learning it.\\p"
    .string "Would you like a free lesson?$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_WaterGunWhichMon::
    .string "Which POKéMON should learn it?$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_WaterGunDeclined::
    .string "No worries. Come back if you\\n"
    .string "change your mind.$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_WaterGunBrock::
    .string "There you go!\\p"
    .string "I hope WATER GUN helps you\\n"
    .string "against BROCK in PEWTER CITY!$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_WaterGunAlreadyTaught::
    .string "I hope that WATER GUN lesson\\n"
    .string "helps you against BROCK!$"

Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution::
    .string "Do you know the evolution-cancel\n"
    .string "technique?\p"
    .string "When a POKéMON is evolving, you\n"
    .string "can stop the process.\p"
    .string "It's a technique for raising\n"
    .string "POKéMON the way they are.$"

